  "guards": [
    "All stated day periods are calendar days; do not convert them to business days.",
    "The 15-day clause 5 clock starts after completion of clause 4 measures, not after deciding which means are needed.",
    "The Bank of Russia routes in clauses 5 and 21 are additional financial-sector routes and do not replace NCCCI or FSB.",
    "The clause 6 30-day clock is conditional on NCCCI finding violations of clauses 3 or 4.",
    "Clause 15 permits either an approved regulation with locations or a request for additional information; Order 553 does not state a new deadline after that request.",
    "The first clause 16 period is 30 calendar days to send a notice; the six-month period caps the preparation time stated in that notice.",
    "The clause 26 seven-day rule and clause 31 forty-five-day rule are minimum lead times before future events, not post-event maxima.",
    "Clause 31 also requires an agreed schedule; the 45-day limit does not eliminate coordination with FSB.",
    "Round-the-clock and uninterrupted operation in clauses 9, 24 and 34 is a continuous mode, not a recurring 24-hour reporting deadline.",
    "FSB operates and maintains PPKA, while the subject or covered body provides infrastructure continuity, safeguarding and technical-condition compliance.",
    "Order 553 contains no special effective-date clause; 2026-01-10 is derived under Decree 763 clause 12 and must not be labeled explicit.",
